# 🧬 GenovaAI - Genetic Prediction System

## 📋 Project Overview

**GenovaAI** is a Flask-based web application for genetic predictions using machine learning models. The system predicts gender and ancestry based on SNP (Single Nucleotide Polymorphism) data and uses Google's Gemini AI to generate predictions about physical characteristics and disease risks.

### Core Capabilities
- 🔬 **Gender Prediction**: ML-based sex prediction from SNP data
- 🌍 **Ancestry Prediction**: Population/ancestry classification using genetic markers
- 🧬 **Physical Characteristics**: AI-generated predictions for hair, eyes, skin, features
- ⚕️ **Disease Risk Assessment**: Population-specific health risk analysis
- 💬 **AI Agent Chat**: LangGraph-powered conversational interface for genetic analysis
- 🖼️ **Portrait Generation**: AI-generated portraits based on genetic predictions

---

## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                       Flask Web Application                      │
│                         (app.py - Port 5001)                     │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Routes (API + Pages)    │    ML Models     │    AI Agent       │
│  - /api/samples          │    - Gender      │    - LangGraph    │
│  - /api/analysis         │    - Ancestry    │    - Gemini LLM   │
│  - /api/predictions      │    - Predictors  │    - Tools        │
│  - /api/agent           │                   │    - Memory       │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│          PostgreSQL (Users, History)  │  MongoDB (SNP Database)  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

