## 🔌 API Endpoints

### Agent API
```
POST /api/agent/chat          # Send message to AI agent
GET  /api/agent/history       # Get chat history
POST /api/agent/clear         # Clear chat history
```

### Analysis API
```
POST /api/analysis/analyze    # Full SNP file analysis
POST /api/analysis/snp        # Query single SNP
POST /api/analysis/snp/multiple  # Query multiple SNPs
POST /api/analysis/statistics # Get SNP statistics
```

### Predictions API
```
POST /api/predictions/physical       # Physical characteristics
POST /api/predictions/disease-risk   # Disease risk assessment
POST /api/predictions/full-report    # Complete genetic report
POST /api/predictions/generate-person-image  # AI portrait
POST /api/predictions/fun-facts      # Genetic fun facts
```

### Samples API
```
GET  /api/samples/list        # List available samples
GET  /api/samples/populations # List all populations
POST /api/samples/info        # Get sample info
POST /api/samples/compare     # Compare two samples
```

